OL,3,ASwedish party blocs tied after Sunday
OL,4,Avote, projections say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSweden's general election remains too
OL,7,Fclose to call, early results suggest.
OL,9,FWith 50% of the votes counted, the two
OL,10,Fmain blocs were separated by only
OL,11,F20,000 votes, Sweden public broadcaster
OL,12,FSVT said.
OL,14,FProjected results from Sweden's
OL,15,Felection authority had given the
OL,16,Fleft-wing political bloc led by the
OL,17,FSocial Democrats' Magdalena Andersson a
OL,18,Fone-seat majority over the rival
OL,19,Ffour-party coalition put together by
OL,20,Fcurrent conservative Prime Minister Ulf
OL,21,FKristersson.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
